{
  "notable_events": [
    "The miller's son, Tomas Stonehand, returned from the capital with a new grinding technique that increased flour output by a third.",
    "A fire broke out in the Restless Fox's kitchen, but was quickly extinguished by patrons forming a bucket brigade from the river.",
    "Duke Aldric levied a new grain tax to fund repairs to the Northmarch road, causing grumbling among the farmers."
  ],
  "texture_line": "The air smells of damp ash from the Fox's fire and the ever-present dust of the mill, while the river's murmur is punctuated by the clank of the new millstone."
}

